      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Cloud Vision AI**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Vision AI for OCR and layout extraction. I will make sure the code specifically identifies it as the external provider. Now, it's time to get started with the `extract_layout.py` file.\n\n\n**Implementing Layout Extraction**\n\nI'm now focused on building the `extract_layout.py` file. I'll implement the `extract_layout` function using Google Cloud Vision AI, specifically using the client library. I'll also ensure provider-specific signals are present in the code.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862800144,
          "start": 1789862797683
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc22e173001E8ZaBfyTBCqirj",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc22dd10001TNuKMTCtT7caii",
